# A shell script with CRLF endings dies on Linux and macOS with a
# 'bad interpreter: /bin/sh^M' that says nothing about the real cause.
# This is the launcher that exists to make those platforms work, so its
# line endings are not left to whatever the contributor's git is set to.
*.sh text eol=lf
*.mjs text eol=lf
*.json text eol=lf
*.md text eol=lf
